rocedures-290125.pdf) | Active now | 2025-01-15 | Escalate to Israeli tax counsel before modeling tax, withholding, or financial-s |\n| [Cross-border IP and transfer pricing](https://kpmg.com/us/en/taxnewsflash/news/2025/11/israel-final-guidance-local-r-and-d-centers-ip-valuations.html) | Needs a date from you | \u2014 | Provide the tax position date for this instance. |\n| [Israeli Registrar online reporting](https://barlaw.co.il/practice_areas/corporate/client_updates/compulsory-online-reporting-to-the-israeli-registrar-of-companies/) | Needs a date from you | \u2014 | Provide the filing date for this instance. |\n| [Israeli flip ruling path is not one-size-fits-all](https://arnontl.com/news/significant-tax-reliefs-in-corporate-restructuring-amendment-to-the-israeli-income-tax-ordinance/) | Needs a date from you | \u2014 | Provide the restructuring approval date for this instance. |\n| [May 2025 Israeli restructuring changes](https://arnontl.com/news/significant-tax-reliefs-in-corporate-restructuring-amendment-to-the-israeli-income-tax-ordinance/) | Needs a date from you | \u2014 | Provide the restructuring effective date for this instance. |\n| [Options, SAFEs, and notes in a flip](https://www.pearlcohen.com/section-102-options-the-unwritten-rules-and-pitfalls-to-look-for/) | Needs a date from you | \u2014 | Provide the flip closing date for this instance. |\n| [QSBS rules are date-sensitive](https://www.thetaxadviser.com/issues/2025/dec/revisiting-sec-1202-strategic-planning-after-the-2025-obbba-expansion/) | Needs a date from you | \u2014 | Provide the stock issue date for this instance. |\n| [Section 102 capital-gains track checklist](https://www.icnl.org/wp-content/uploads/Israel_Ordinance.pdf) | Needs a date from you | \u2014 | Provide the grant date for this instance. |\n| [Section 102 double-trigger acceleration treatment](https://www.shibolet.com/en/double-trigger-acceleration-upon-exit-or-ipo/) | Needs a date from you | \u2014 | Provide the transaction e